config MTD_NAND_ZTE_SPIFC
	bool "ZTE ZX27912x SPIFC SPI-NAND controller"
	depends on MTD
	help
	  Support for the ZTE ZX27912x SPI Flash Controller (SPIFC) attached
	  to an SPI-NAND chip. This bring-up driver implements chip
	  identification and page reads only; program and erase are not
	  implemented, so the resulting MTD device is read-only.

	  If unsure, say N.
